					<div class="summary" style="margin-bottom: 594.667px; opacity: 0.0131602;"><p><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;"><font dir="auto" style="vertical-align: inherit;">A large collective on the main Venetian artists of the sixteenth century, particularly interested in the representation of female beauty.</font></font></p></div>
			</div>
